D、Albuminuria 將DPP4i(或TZD)轉成SGLT2i 等，業已於「110 年5 月\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b16","block_number":16,"bbox":[67.8905029296875,622.9605102539062,302.4286804199219,637.00048828125],"raw_text":"26 日第二次南區委員會會議」通過。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b17","block_number":17,"bbox":[25.53179931640625,648.0359497070312,410.55072021484375,662.075927734375],"raw_text":"  三、什麼情況可以開立TZD，DPP4 and SGLT2 inhibitors？ \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b18","block_number":18,"bbox":[65.85467529296875,672.9990234375,569.9608154296875,687.0390014648438],"raw_text":"1、已接受Metformin使用劑量達1000mg/day，三個月以上，且HbA1仍大於等於7%之\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b19","block_number":19,"bbox":[93.79421997070312,697.962158203125,212.76918029785156,712.0021362304688],"raw_text":"第二型糖尿病人。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b20","block_number":20,"bbox":[65.8265380859375,723.03759765625,485.7488708496094,737.0775756835938],"raw_text":"2、Metformin有禁忌症（如eGFR<30）或副作用，即可第一線開立。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b21","block_number":21,"bbox":[65.8125,748.000732421875,569.917236328125,762.0407104492188],"raw_text":"3、80歲以上第二型糖尿病患者，以前未使用過Metformin者(醫師裁量)；如果病患\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p1-b22","block_number":22,"bbox":[87.041015625,772.9638061523438,563.07275390625,787.0037841796875],"raw_text":"是80歲以前就已經使用metformin 且病情穩定，Creatinine正常的病患，雖達\n"}],"raw_text":"1 \n中華民國醫師公會全國聯合會 \n西醫基層醫療服務審查執行會南區分會 \n「110 年10 月27 日審查專家諮詢會議」會議記錄 \n開會時間：110 年10 月27 日（三）下午13：30 \n開會地點：視訊會議 \n出席人員：賴俊良主任委員、顏大翔副主任委員、徐超群副主任委員、趙善楷副主任委員、\n陳相國委員、蔡國麟秘書長、端木梁組長、李明陽副組長、楊忠錫總召、劉晉\n瑋副總召、葉雲宇副總召、王家麟副總召、陳俊文副總召、李昭榮副總召、魏\n大倫副總召、陳炳諴副總召、110 年各科召集人、中央健保署南區業務組：黃\n紫雲科長、洪欀皊視察、許雅婷小姐。 \n請假人員：丁榮哲副主任委員 \n會務人員：陳美惠、周芷妤 \n主席：端木梁審查組長                                          紀錄與整理:陳美惠 \n一、 主席致詞 \n二、 各科召集人報告該科審查狀況 \n三、 提案討論                                                \n \n \n提案一                                            提案人︰審查組 \n案由：建請重申及討論南區糖尿病下列用藥審查共識。 \n說明： \n一、 口服降血糖藥物Metformin使用最大耐受劑量已調低為1000mg，業已於「110年3\n月3日第一次南區委員會會議」通過。 \n  二、糖尿病用藥TZD、DPP4i、SGLT2i 三者得互相轉換：符合這三類藥物的給付規定並\n檢附起始治療的相關病歷與檢驗報告，經具體詳實記載新的臨床症狀，有轉換的必\n要時，TZD、DPP4i、SGLT2i 三者得互相轉換。例如：因水腫將TZD 轉成DPP4i；或\n有CHF、CKD、Albuminuria 將DPP4i(或TZD)轉成SGLT2i 等，業已於「110 年5 月\n26 日第二次南區委員會會議」通過。 \n  三、什麼情況可以開立TZD，DPP4 and SGLT2 inhibitors？ \n1、已接受Metformin使用劑量達1000mg/day，三個月以上，且HbA1仍大於等於7%之\n第二型糖尿病人。 \n2、Metformin有禁忌症（如eGFR<30）或副作用，即可第一線開立。 \n3、80歲以上第二型糖尿病患者，以前未使用過Metformin者(醫師裁量)；如果病患\n是80歲以前就已經使用metformin 且病情穩定，Creatinine正常的病患，雖達\n","low_text":false,"independent_check":"NORMALIZED_EXACT","preview_url":"/api/meeting-preview/MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5/1.png"},{"page":2,"blocks":[{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b1","block_number":1,"bbox":[87.12000274658203,22.95397186279297,311.1001281738281,36.99397277832031],"raw_text":"80歲了，仍可繼續處方metformin。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b2","block_number":2,"bbox":[32.518463134765625,48.02941131591797,564.66552734375,62.06941223144531],"raw_text":" 四、什麼情況可以開立DPP4/SGLT2 inhibitors複方製劑？一定要連續2次HbA1c>7.5% \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b3","block_number":3,"bbox":[72.4622802734375,72.99254608154297,107.43592071533203,87.03254699707031],"raw_text":"嗎？ \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b4","block_number":4,"bbox":[73.52932739257812,97.95568084716797,563.615234375,111.99568176269531],"raw_text":"1、不需要，只要第6個月的HbA1c>7.5%即可。目前健保規範為限用於已接受過最\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b5","block_number":5,"bbox":[87.55526733398438,123.03112030029297,569.9443969726562,137.0711212158203],"raw_text":"大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用 SGLT-2 或DPP-4抑制劑治療至少6個月，糖化\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b6","block_number":6,"bbox":[87.541259765625,147.9942626953125,521.5176391601562,162.0342559814453],"raw_text":"血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者（僅限使用有相同成分的複方製劑）。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b7","block_number":7,"bbox":[70.8616943359375,172.9573974609375,420.8367614746094,186.9973907470703],"raw_text":"2、可參閱南區委員會網站提供的「三高用藥查檢表」。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b8","block_number":8,"bbox":[25.498443603515625,198.0328369140625,137.5800018310547,212.0739288330078],"raw_text":"辦法：請討論。  \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b9","block_number":9,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,222.22499084472656,153.17999267578125,237.22499084472656],"raw_text":"決議：照案通過。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b10","block_number":10,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,247.9539794921875,32.57999801635742,261.99395751953125],"raw_text":" \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b11","block_number":11,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,273.033935546875,32.57999801635742,287.07391357421875],"raw_text":" \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b12","block_number":12,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,297.99395751953125,571.6199951171875,312.033935546875],"raw_text":"提案二                                            提案人︰審查組 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b13","block_number":13,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,322.1849670410156,577.3800048828125,337.1849670410156],"raw_text":"案由：建請討論HCV reflex testing 申報方式及C型肝炎-核醣核酸類定量檢驗管控 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b14","block_number":14,"bbox":[70.55999755859375,347.26495361328125,123.05999755859375,362.26495361328125],"raw_text":"方法？ \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b15","block_number":15,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,372.99395751953125,74.57363891601562,387.033935546875],"raw_text":"說明： \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b16","block_number":16,"bbox":[44.513999938964844,397.95709228515625,569.7615966796875,411.9970703125],"raw_text":"一、HCV reflex testing申報方式將自費用年月110年10月起生效。系提供另一種執行\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b17","block_number":17,"bbox":[72.481689453125,423.03253173828125,562.5507202148438,437.072509765625],"raw_text":"成人預防保健之C型肝炎抗體及RNA檢驗之申報方式，院所可自行選擇是否要執行\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b18","block_number":18,"bbox":[72.46766662597656,447.99566650390625,310.48779296875,462.03564453125],"raw_text":"HCV reflex testing。（見附件二）  \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b19","block_number":19,"bbox":[44.5140380859375,472.95880126953125,569.4962768554688,486.998779296875],"raw_text":"二、若成人預防保健 C型肝炎篩檢陽性，俟院所執行完成 C型肝炎-核醣核酸類定量擴\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b20","block_number":20,"bbox":[72.45364379882812,498.03424072265625,569.9610595703125,512.07421875],"raw_text":"增試驗後，合併成人預防保健第一階段 (含C型肝炎篩檢:醫令代碼L1001C)及C型肝\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b21","block_number":21,"bbox":[72.43966674804688,522.9973754882812,429.4908752441406,537.037353515625],"raw_text":"炎-核醣核酸類定量擴增試驗(醫令代碼為12185C)申報。  \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b22","block_number":22,"bbox":[44.471954345703125,547.9605102539062,569.7012329101562,562.00048828125],"raw_text":"三、C型肝炎抗體及RNA檢驗費用是由診所端或檢驗所端申報？是否上傳VPN雲端以資訊\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b23","block_number":23,"bbox":[72.42556762695312,573.0359497070312,275.4018249511719,587.075927734375],"raw_text":"共享，避免重複檢驗(附件三)。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b24","block_number":24,"bbox":[44.45787048339844,597.9990844726562,548.52197265625,612.0390625],"raw_text":"四、如何管控C型肝炎-RNA(醫令代碼為12185C)檢驗？避免重複及不需要之檢驗？ \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b25","block_number":25,"bbox":[25.50390625,622.9622192382812,130.56521606445312,637.002197265625],"raw_text":"辦法：請討論。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b26","block_number":26,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,644.8749389648438,494.2200012207031,663.6604614257812],"raw_text":"決議：1. C 型肝炎-RNA 的檢驗要在Anti-HCV 篩檢呈陽性後才考慮做。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b27","block_number":27,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,672.2249755859375,569.8800048828125,687.2249755859375],"raw_text":"      2.先在VPN 雲端查詢未做過C 型肝炎-RNA 檢驗後才檢測，申報費用者請將檢\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b28","block_number":28,"bbox":[82.31999969482422,697.1849365234375,239.94000244140625,712.1849365234375],"raw_text":"驗結果上傳雲端共享。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b29","block_number":29,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,722.2649536132812,427.260009765625,737.2649536132812],"raw_text":"      3.建議健保署做C 型肝炎-RNA 重複檢驗的API 提醒。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b30","block_number":30,"bbox":[70.68000030517578,747.2249755859375,569.760009765625,762.2249755859375],"raw_text":"4.分會將建議南區業務組對C 型肝炎-RNA 做相關的檔案分析，並討論管控方\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p2-b31","block_number":31,"bbox":[82.19999694824219,772.1849365234375,329.94000244140625,787.1849365234375],"raw_text":"式，以避免做重複及不必要之檢驗。 \n"}],"raw_text":"2 \n80歲了，仍可繼續處方metformin。 \n 四、什麼情況可以開立DPP4/SGLT2 inhibitors複方製劑？一定要連續2次HbA1c>7.5% \n嗎？ \n1、不需要，只要第6個月的HbA1c>7.5%即可。目前健保規範為限用於已接受過最\n大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用 SGLT-2 或DPP-4抑制劑治療至少6個月，糖化\n血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者（僅限使用有相同成分的複方製劑）。 \n2、可參閱南區委員會網站提供的「三高用藥查檢表」。 \n辦法：請討論。  \n決議：照案通過。 \n \n \n提案二                                            提案人︰審查組 \n案由：建請討論HCV reflex testing 申報方式及C型肝炎-核醣核酸類定量檢驗管控 \n方法？ \n說明： \n一、HCV reflex testing申報方式將自費用年月110年10月起生效。系提供另一種執行\n成人預防保健之C型肝炎抗體及RNA檢驗之申報方式，院所可自行選擇是否要執行\nHCV reflex testing。（見附件二）  \n二、若成人預防保健 C型肝炎篩檢陽性，俟院所執行完成 C型肝炎-核醣核酸類定量擴\n增試驗後，合併成人預防保健第一階段 (含C型肝炎篩檢:醫令代碼L1001C)及C型肝\n炎-核醣核酸類定量擴增試驗(醫令代碼為12185C)申報。  \n三、C型肝炎抗體及RNA檢驗費用是由診所端或檢驗所端申報？是否上傳VPN雲端以資訊\n共享，避免重複檢驗(附件三)。 \n四、如何管控C型肝炎-RNA(醫令代碼為12185C)檢驗？避免重複及不需要之檢驗？ \n辦法：請討論。 \n決議：1. C 型肝炎-RNA 的檢驗要在Anti-HCV 篩檢呈陽性後才考慮做。 \n      2.先在VPN 雲端查詢未做過C 型肝炎-RNA 檢驗後才檢測，申報費用者請將檢\n驗結果上傳雲端共享。 \n      3.建議健保署做C 型肝炎-RNA 重複檢驗的API 提醒。 \n4.分會將建議南區業務組對C 型肝炎-RNA 做相關的檔案分析，並討論管控方\n式，以避免做重複及不必要之檢驗。 \n","low_text":false,"independent_check":"NORMALIZED_EXACT","preview_url":"/api/meeting-preview/MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5/2.png"},{"page":3,"blocks":[{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b1","block_number":1,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,22.95397186279297,32.57999801635742,36.99397277832031],"raw_text":" \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b2","block_number":2,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,48.02941131591797,571.6199951171875,62.07392883300781],"raw_text":"提案三                                              提案人︰審查組 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b3","block_number":3,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,72.22499084472656,566.1599731445312,87.22499084472656],"raw_text":"案由：建請討論有關106-108 年開放表別項目中，申報金額大於預估金額之項目，\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b4","block_number":4,"bbox":[73.80000305175781,97.18501281738281,193.86000061035156,112.18501281738281],"raw_text":"南區申報情況。  \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b5","block_number":5,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,123.03392791748047,569.8753051757812,137.0739288330078],"raw_text":"說明：西醫基層醫療服務審查執行會提供106-108 年開放表別項目中，申報金額大於預估\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b6","block_number":6,"bbox":[67.91867065429688,147.9970703125,292.025146484375,162.0370635986328],"raw_text":"金額之項目表計10 項，如附件四。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b7","block_number":7,"bbox":[25.55999755859375,172.960205078125,567.4885864257812,187.0001983642578],"raw_text":"辦法：建議南區業務組協助分析該些項目申報之分區別、院所科別及疾病別等相關申報資\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b8","block_number":8,"bbox":[67.93269348144531,198.03564453125,200.94766235351562,212.0756378173828],"raw_text":"料，提委員會討論。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b9","block_number":9,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,222.22499084472656,558.5399780273438,237.22499084472656],"raw_text":"決議：照案通過，請健保署南區業務組分析上述相關項目後，提審查會議討論。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b10","block_number":10,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,247.9539794921875,32.57999801635742,261.99395751953125],"raw_text":" \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b11","block_number":11,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,273.0294189453125,571.6199951171875,287.07391357421875],"raw_text":"提案四                                              提案人︰審查組 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b12","block_number":12,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,297.2249755859375,442.260009765625,312.2249755859375],"raw_text":"案由：增列糖尿病用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist。  \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-1f811b